[TITLE]
InpWriter round-trip fixture: [USER_FLAG_VALUES] row order
The rows are listed out of order. The writer must save them sorted by object
type, object name and flag name, not in the order of its hash map.

[OPTIONS]
FLOW_UNITS           CFS
INFILTRATION         HORTON
FLOW_ROUTING         DYNWAVE
START_DATE           01/01/2020
START_TIME           00:00:00
END_DATE             01/02/2020
END_TIME             00:00:00
ROUTING_STEP         0:00:30

[JUNCTIONS]
;;Name  Elev  MaxDepth  InitDepth  SurDepth  Aponded
J3       12.0  5.0       0          0         0
J30      11.5  5.0       0          0         0
J4       11.0  5.0       0          0         0

[OUTFALLS]
;;Name  Elev  Type  StageData  Gated
O1       9.0   FREE  *          NO

[CONDUITS]
;;Name  FromNode  ToNode  Length  Roughness  InOffset  OutOffset
C1       J3        J30     300.0   0.013      0         0
C2       J30       J4      300.0   0.013      0         0
C3       J4        O1      300.0   0.013      0         0

[XSECTIONS]
;;Link  Shape     Geom1  Geom2  Geom3  Geom4  Barrels
C1       CIRCULAR  1.0    0      0      0      1
C2       CIRCULAR  1.0    0      0      0      1
C3       CIRCULAR  1.0    0      0      0      1

[USER_FLAGS]
Owner    STRING
Zone     INTEGER

[USER_FLAG_VALUES]
NODE     J4    Zone   4
NODE     J4    Owner  county
NODE     J30   Owner  state
NODE     J3    Zone   3
NODE     J3    Owner  city
LINK     C3    Zone   2
LINK     C2    Owner  city
LINK     C1    Zone   1

[REPORT]
INPUT       NO

[COORDINATES]
;;Node  X-Coord  Y-Coord
J3       0.0      0.0
J30      150.0    0.0
J4       300.0    0.0
O1       600.0    0.0
